<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>APOCALYPSE X KHADIJA</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #050505;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      padding: 25px 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #888;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      border: 1px solid white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: white;
      color: black;
    }

    section {
      padding: 50px 20px;
      background: #101010;
    }

    section h2 {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #181818;
      border: 1px solid #292929;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #aaa;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>APOCALYPSE X KHADIJA</h1>
    <p>Deux âmes • Une histoire</p>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <h2>APOCALYPSE X KHADIJA</h2>

      <p>
        Bienvenue dans notre univers.<br>
        Une histoire construite sur la confiance,
        le respect et les souvenirs.
      </p>

      <a href="#histoire" class="button">ENTRER</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="histoire">
    <h2>NOTRE HISTOIRE</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
        APOCALYPSE X KHADIJA<br><br>
        Une histoire unique, un lien particulier
        et des moments qui restent gravés.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 APOCALYPSE X KHADIJA
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
